        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/paul/{size}/5862_2.png",
        "created_at": "2017-08-13T04:17:40.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>It'll be a bit, unfortunately. The starter kit is basically done, an we will be showing it off and using it for Gen Con demos, but it has a little bit of pre-press work remaining, and then it has to be manufactured, before it will be sent to distributors.</p><p>Fortunately, it will be manufactured in the US, so the turnaround time is 6-8 weeks instead of the usual 12-16 for overseas manufacturing.</p>",
